<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">Intelligent pet care</div><h1>Smarter care.<br>Happier pets.</h1><p>Thoughtfully selected smart products that make everyday pet care simpler, calmer and more connected.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/collections/all">Explore smart care</a><a class="button alt" href="#featured">View collection</a></div></div><div class="hero-media">{% if section.settings.hero_image %}{{ section.settings.hero_image | image_url: width: 2200 | image_tag: loading: 'eager', widths: '900,1200,1600,2200' }}{% elsif collections.all.products.first.featured_image %}{{ collections.all.products.first.featured_image | image_url: width: 2200 | image_tag: loading: 'eager' }}{% endif %}</div></section><section class="section page-width" id="featured"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">The collection</div><h2>Smart care, beautifully simplified.</h2></div><div class="section-intro">A focused collection of smart feeders, pet-care technology and everyday essentials selected for modern pet parents.</div></div><div class="products-grid">{% for product in collections.all.products limit:6 %}<a class="card" href="{{ product.url }}"><div class="card-media">{% if product.featured_image %}{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '500,800,1100' }}{% endif %}</div><div class="card-info"><h3 class="card-title">{{ product.title }}</h3><div class="card-price">{{ product.price | money }}</div></div></a>{% endfor %}</div></section><section class="section page-width"><div class="feature"><div class="feature-copy"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#aaa">For modern pet parents</div><h2>More care.<br>Less routine.</h2><p>Automate the everyday moments that matter while keeping your pet's comfort at the center. Designed to look at home in your space and work quietly in the background.</p><a class="button" href="/collections/all" style="width:max-content;background:#fff;color:#111">Shop smart care</a></div><div class="feature-media">{% if section.settings.feature_image %}{{ section.settings.feature_image | image_url: width: 1600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy' }}{% elsif collections.all.products[1].featured_image %}{{ collections.all.products[1].featured_image | image_url: width: 1600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy' }}{% endif %}</div></div></section><section class="section page-width"><div class="benefits"><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-number">01</div><h3>Smart by design</h3><p>Technology that fits naturally into everyday pet care without adding visual clutter.</p></div><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-number">02</div><h3>Less to manage</h3><p>Automate routines and spend more time on the part that actually matters: your pet.</p></div><div class="benefit"><div class="benefit-number">03</div><h3>Made for real homes</h3><p>Practical products selected for modern spaces, busy schedules and everyday use.</p></div></div></section><section class="section page-width"><div class="newsletter"><div class="eyebrow">Stay in the loop</div><h2>Better care starts here.</h2><p>Get product launches, care tips and occasional offers from {{ shop.name }}.</p>{% form 'customer' %}<input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter"><div class="newsletter-form"><input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="Your email" required><button class="button" type="submit">Subscribe</button></div>{% endform %}</div></section>{% schema %}{"name":"Premium homepage","settings":[{"type":"image_picker","id":"hero_image","label":"Hero image"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"feature_image","label":"Feature image"}]}{% endschema %}